---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import ProjectPageHero from '../../components/ProjectPageHero.astro';
import ProjectDetailSections from '../../components/ProjectDetailSections.astro';
import { BYTELITE } from '../../data/projects';
import { RESEARCH_ROUTES } from '../../data/research';
---

<Layout
  noindex={true}
  title="ByteLite | Deterministic Digital Structure | ByteLite LLC"
  description="ByteLite is ByteLite LLC's deterministic digital-structure foundation: exact lossless reconstruction as the first proof surface, ahead of any compression claim."
  keywords="ByteLite, deterministic structure, exact reconstruction, ByteLite LLC"
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <section class="section-sm">
    <div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Technologies', href: '/technologies' }, { label: 'ByteLite' }]} /></div>
  </section>

  <ProjectPageHero project={BYTELITE} />

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
      <img src="/technologies/bytelite-technology-mark.webp" alt="ByteLite technology mark" width="320" height="213" style="width:200px;height:auto;margin-bottom:1.75rem;" loading="lazy" />
      <p class="eyebrow">Mission</p>
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Identity first. Compression second.</h2>
      <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.8;">{BYTELITE.mission}</p>
      <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.8;margin-top:1rem;">
        ByteLite is the foundation layer of the ByteLite LLC architecture — Deep Kore and ByteSight
        are designed to build on the structural guarantees ByteLite is responsible for proving first.
        Internal encoding rules, generator details, and carrier formats are trade secrets and are not
        disclosed on this site.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ProjectDetailSections project={BYTELITE} />

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Research Context</p>
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Why structure matters beyond compression.</h2>
      <p class="bl-research">
        ByteLite's research role is to produce deterministic structural evidence that downstream
        systems can inspect. Compression is the first measurable proof surface because both halves
        of it can be tested exactly: either the artifact reconstructs byte for byte, or it does
        not, and either the counted output is smaller, or it is not.
      </p>
      <p class="bl-research">
        That is the whole reason this layer carries the earliest evidence load. A reduction shows
        that some repeated information has been represented through a reusable structure. It does
        not show that the structure means anything, and this site does not treat compression as
        evidence of understanding.
      </p>
      <p class="bl-research">
        The broader research question is what happens next: whether canonical structural artifacts
        can eventually serve as teaching evidence for more direct deterministic interpretation, so
        that a reasoning system reads structure it would otherwise have had to re-derive. That is a
        hypothesis with no supporting evidence today, and it is recorded as one.
      </p>
      <div class="pd-related-row" style="margin-top:1.75rem;">
        <a href={RESEARCH_ROUTES.thesis} class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Read the Research Thesis &rarr;</a>
        <a href={RESEARCH_ROUTES.plainEnglish} class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Plain-English Explanation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Related</p>
      <div class="pd-related-row">
        <a href="/architecture" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">The Complete Architecture</a>
        <a href="/technologies/bytesight" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">ByteSight &rarr;</a>
        <a href="/technologies/deep-kore" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Deep Kore &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>

<style>
.pd-related-row { display: flex; gap: .75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.pd-related-row .btn { white-space: normal; text-align: center; }
.bl-research { font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #a0a8c0; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
</style>
